      "reason": "THIRD widening in one night, and the one that made the guard honest. Review pass 5 found the resolver accepted every three-character alphanumeric word as an identifier, so a marker whose payload is PROSE resolved through ordinary English \u2014 'a future \"swap-target output sanity\" hardening' resolved via the word 'future'. That did not merely inflate the resolved count; the guard was reporting prose as a followable referent, which is the exact claim it exists to test, and the 114-resolved figure had already been published to the operator. A token must now contain a digit. The orphan count rose 103 to 137 because the instrument stopped counting words as promises, not because the debt grew."
